---
description: Tests, fixtures, and golden files
globs: **/tests/**,**/tests.rs,kuro-rs/fixtures/**
alwaysApply: false
---
Deterministic tests only: no sleep, no network, no env mutation, no real devices.
Use `kuro_core::testkit` fakes when simulating time, HTTP, or config (feature testkit).
Golden and snapshot files change only with an intentional, reviewed diff.
Router corpus updates belong beside the failing case, not drive-by edits.
Mark hardware-dependent tests `#[ignore]` with a reason, not silent `return`.
Bless workflows wait until `KURO_BLESS=1` is documented in phase 11.
Parity tests compare Rust and shell JSON; keep payloads stable across refactors.